verb lower_wall_timer_clears "The fire wall drops is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 150
  take timer_lower_wall
  unless phase_lower_wall

verb wall_open_timer_clears "The fire wall is down is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 290
  take timer_wall_open
  unless phase_wall_open

verb rise_wall_timer_clears "The fire wall rises again is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 360
  take timer_rise_wall
  unless phase_rise_wall

verb rise_chase_timer_clears "The chasing wall rises is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 500
